<appendix id="installation">
<title>Installation</title>

<para>&kappname; is built with CMake. It needs Qt 6.7 or newer, KDE Frameworks 6, zint, CUPS and libudev; the handbook needs KDocTools. <filename>INSTALL.md</filename> in the source lists every requirement, the packages for common distributions, the build options and how to set up each kind of printer.</para>

<programlisting>cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr
cmake --build build
cmake --install build</programlisting>

<para>The source is at <ulink url="https://github.com/nvaert1986/plasma-label-creator">github.com/nvaert1986/plasma-label-creator</ulink>.</para>
</appendix>

</book>
